WEBVTT

00:07.690 --> 00:12.150
Les Misérables

00:07.690 --> 00:12.150
A Girl Named Cosette

00:08.690 --> 00:11.690
Beyond the wind

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
The wind blows

00:12.150 --> 00:15.620
Kaze ga fuki nuketeku

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
over the daisies blooming over the stone pavement

00:15.620 --> 00:22.160
Ishidatami ni saku hinagiku

00:22.160 --> 00:25.710
I held my knees

00:22.160 --> 00:25.710
Hiza wo tsuite

00:25.710 --> 00:31.210
and gazed at the flowers

00:25.710 --> 00:31.210
Jitto mitsumeteta

00:31.210 --> 00:34.930
Far away, very far away

00:31.210 --> 00:34.930
Tooku haruka tooku

00:34.930 --> 00:41.560
A gentle voice is calling me

00:34.930 --> 00:41.560
Watashi wo yobu yasashii koe

00:41.560 --> 00:45.140
Let's go look for it

00:41.560 --> 00:45.140
Sagashii ni yukou

00:45.140 --> 00:50.900
Even if we wander aimlessly

00:45.140 --> 00:50.900
Attemonai keredo

00:50.900 --> 00:55.700
The rain comes down

00:50.900 --> 00:55.700
Doushaburi no ame

00:55.700 --> 01:00.450
on a lonely morning

00:55.700 --> 01:00.450
Hitoribocchi no asa

01:00.450 --> 01:04.960
But look, beyond the clouds

01:00.450 --> 01:04.960
Demo hora kumo no mukou

01:04.960 --> 01:09.540
the sunlight is peering at us

01:04.960 --> 01:09.540
Hizashi ga nozoiteruyo

01:09.540 --> 01:11.920
Wipe away your tears

01:09.540 --> 01:11.920
Namida fuite

01:11.920 --> 01:14.840
Look forward

01:11.920 --> 01:14.840
Mae wo muite

01:14.840 --> 01:19.180
and summon all of your strength

01:14.840 --> 01:19.180
Ashimoto chikara komete

01:19.180 --> 01:21.510
Let's walk

01:19.180 --> 01:21.510
Aruite yukou

01:21.510 --> 01:23.890
I'm sure we will make it

01:21.510 --> 01:23.890
Kitto yukeru

01:23.890 --> 01:31.230
The road, the road, continues on...

01:23.890 --> 01:31.230
Michi wa michi wa tsuzuku yo...

01:31.230 --> 01:34.320
forever...

01:31.230 --> 01:34.320
Dokomademo

01:53.890 --> 01:55.260
I'm going!

01:56.230 --> 01:58.250
Wait a minute, Éponine.

01:59.560 --> 02:01.670
Your collar is crooked.

02:01.690 --> 02:04.880
All right, this is good. Do your best in your studies.

02:04.900 --> 02:05.920
Yes, I will!

02:16.200 --> 02:18.230
Cosette! Cosette!

02:20.670 --> 02:23.400
What?! You're still cleaning up the stable?!

02:23.800 --> 02:25.190
Ah... Yes, I am.

02:25.210 --> 02:29.360
You re really slow! Finish up quickly and wash the dishes!

02:29.720 --> 02:33.200
After that, go and clean the rooms on the second floor again!

02:33.510 --> 02:34.280
Yes.

02:36.060 --> 02:37.700
Geez, that child...

02:39.810 --> 02:43.250
Why can't I make any profit?

02:45.530 --> 02:48.010
Dear, are those the accounts of the inn?

02:48.900 --> 02:52.180
I can do something about it if we can wait for another ten days.

02:53.240 --> 02:57.930
That stubborn old hag, she said today's the last day.

03:06.130 --> 03:07.070
Cosette.

03:08.920 --> 03:11.150
Can I ask you to do an errand?

03:11.590 --> 03:15.090
But, I haven't done the cleaning, carried the water or done the laundry yet...

03:16.310 --> 03:18.620
You can do those later!

03:19.310 --> 03:22.040
Help me go over to the store where they sell liquor.

03:23.400 --> 03:24.290
Yes.

03:34.400 --> 03:39.360
A New Friend, Chou Chou

03:40.250 --> 03:41.180
I'm going.

03:41.870 --> 03:43.020
Wait!

03:45.170 --> 03:46.110
I'll go too!

04:07.570 --> 04:08.710
No way!

04:09.440 --> 04:11.800
I won't wait another day.

04:11.820 --> 04:16.180
Please! The mistress hopes you can wait for another month!

04:16.200 --> 04:17.220
I beg you!

04:17.620 --> 04:24.060
Hmmph! She thinks she can persuade me with children.
Geez... Thénardier and his wife are really sly.

04:27.000 --> 04:29.980
Please! Please wait for another month!

04:30.630 --> 04:33.070
If you can't, I won't be able to get my dinner...

04:35.390 --> 04:39.580
Cosette will starve! Have pity on her!

04:42.640 --> 04:45.790
Ten days. I won't wait any longer than that.

04:49.110 --> 04:51.000
Yes, thank you very much.

04:58.120 --> 04:59.180
Cosette...

04:59.200 --> 05:01.510
Did my mother scold you again?

05:03.660 --> 05:06.690
Gavroche, you don't have to worry; I'm all right.

05:08.420 --> 05:09.810
There are so many flowers!

05:11.130 --> 05:13.190
Let's play a bit.

05:13.470 --> 05:14.190
Okay.

05:25.560 --> 05:26.500
Gavroche!

05:36.070 --> 05:36.800
Here you go!

05:49.960 --> 05:50.770
It's delicious.

05:51.090 --> 05:52.400
It was delicious.

05:53.380 --> 05:55.070
Ah, it's a butterfly.

06:26.250 --> 06:27.980
I found him.

06:29.370 --> 06:30.730
I found him over there!

06:34.960 --> 06:37.400
It tickles! Stop it! Stop it!

06:38.130 --> 06:40.320
Why are you so fluffy?

06:44.140 --> 06:46.290
I'll name you “Chou Chou".

06:46.310 --> 06:47.410
"Chou Chou"?

06:47.480 --> 06:49.250
Ah! Chou Chou! Chou Chou!

06:50.520 --> 06:54.880
Do you like it? Do you like your new name, Chou Chou?

06:58.360 --> 06:59.470
Now, come over here, Chou Chou.

07:00.950 --> 07:02.340
Wait for me!

07:14.130 --> 07:15.580
See you later, Chou Chou.

07:15.800 --> 07:17.150
Bye bye!

07:26.470 --> 07:27.660
As I thought...

07:28.890 --> 07:31.960
You shouldn't, Chou Chou. Didn't I say you can't follow me?

07:33.440 --> 07:35.290
Cosette! Cosette!

07:39.150 --> 07:44.150
But it's not possible. Both Thénardier and the mistress won't allow it.

07:49.870 --> 07:53.410
I'm sorry, Chou Chou. We can't keep you.

07:53.880 --> 07:59.400
It's better for you to return to your mother's side. Understand?

08:04.140 --> 08:07.160
No, you can't. Let's go, Gavroche.

08:25.120 --> 08:27.390
Thank goodness. He seems to have given up.

08:28.620 --> 08:34.390
Even for Chou Chou, he will only be happy
when he returns to his mother. So let's go.

08:37.960 --> 08:39.080
Chou Chou!

08:39.920 --> 08:42.740
What? You really did follow us.

08:47.300 --> 08:48.200
Watch out!

08:52.310 --> 08:54.500
Cosette! Cosette!

08:55.270 --> 08:57.000
Are you okay, Cosette?

08:57.690 --> 08:58.330
Yes.

09:00.110 --> 09:05.380
You shouldn't do that, Chou Chou, Didn't I say you can't follow me?

09:10.450 --> 09:13.350
You're late! How long were you intending to stay out?!

09:13.790 --> 09:15.450
I'm sorry.

09:15.460 --> 09:18.310
So, how did the other party respond?

09:18.630 --> 09:21.730
She said she can only wait for another ten days.

09:23.420 --> 09:24.440
What?!

09:24.880 --> 09:29.530
I'm sorry. I asked if she can wait for another month, but she wouldn't relent.

09:29.850 --> 09:35.910
Geez, you are really useless. You won't have dinner tonight, understood?

09:42.110 --> 09:45.760
Now, hurry and finish the rest of the cleaning!

09:47.240 --> 09:49.470
If you don't hurry, the sun is going to set!

09:50.120 --> 09:50.760
Yes.

10:01.130 --> 10:02.580
Cosette.

10:02.840 --> 10:03.940
Over here, over here.

10:07.430 --> 10:13.550
So you were here, Chou Chou. We are going to be in trouble
if the mistress finds out, so we have to hide you here.

10:20.650 --> 10:22.840
And how was it?

10:22.860 --> 10:25.590
Oh, right. Back to the topic, Dear.

10:26.360 --> 10:30.050
As I thought, I was right to have Cosette ask for another month.

10:30.570 --> 10:33.760
She said she can't wait for a month, but she can wait for ten days.

10:33.790 --> 10:34.890
Really?

10:35.250 --> 10:39.560
If we asked for ten days right from the start, I bet she wouldn't agree!

10:41.840 --> 10:44.230
Your evil is really working well here.

10:44.630 --> 10:47.000
Because I'm your wife.

10:49.720 --> 10:51.360
I wonder if there's a wild dog.

10:52.140 --> 10:53.070
Mother!

10:54.470 --> 10:56.950
Have Cosette wash this, too.

10:57.640 --> 11:00.370
This is my favorite blouse, so she has to be careful with it.

11:01.100 --> 11:03.850
What? Can't you just bring it to her yourself?

11:06.480 --> 11:08.920
Chou Chou, you can't do this! Chou Chou!

11:21.000 --> 11:21.980
Cosette.

11:45.480 --> 11:49.460
Cosette? Was there a dog here?

11:51.700 --> 11:54.640
I thought I heard barking...

11:55.580 --> 11:56.970
Uhh... it's nothing...

11:58.830 --> 12:00.890
You smell like an animal.

12:07.300 --> 12:09.360
What? Oh, I know... it came from the horse.

12:10.210 --> 12:14.070
Here, take this. This is a very important piece, so be careful when washing it.

12:14.300 --> 12:14.950
Yes.

12:15.180 --> 12:19.080
Hurry up and finish this up. You still have a lot of work to do.

12:35.160 --> 12:36.970
I have an appointment with Mayor Madeleine.

12:42.330 --> 12:46.940
Monsieur Madeleine. The new policeman sent by the ministry,
Monsieur Javert, has come to pay his respects.

12:47.960 --> 12:48.650
Javert...

12:51.010 --> 12:52.110
Monsieur Madeleine?

12:52.130 --> 12:55.610
Oh, is it the new police inspector? Ask him to come in.

12:55.640 --> 12:56.240
Yes.

12:58.350 --> 12:59.660
Please come in.

13:05.230 --> 13:11.670
Sorry to disturb your work. I'm the newly appointed police inspector, Javert.

13:13.030 --> 13:15.170
I have heard rumors about you already.

13:16.860 --> 13:19.800
I was informed that an extremely competent
police inspector has been appointed.

13:26.210 --> 13:27.810
Is there something wrong?

13:28.540 --> 13:29.480
It is nothing.

13:30.550 --> 13:35.280
Long ago, I worked as a prison warden in Toulon.

13:36.470 --> 13:37.490
In Toulon...

13:41.350 --> 13:44.580
In that place, there was a big man with great strength.

13:45.890 --> 13:50.960
He tried to escape prison many times. After being
released, he stole a young man's silver coin.

13:51.770 --> 13:52.590
It was a repeated offense.

13:53.990 --> 13:56.920
If he gets caught again, I guess he won't be able to avoid life imprisonment.

13:59.120 --> 14:05.390
My apologies, but looking at your face reminds me of that man.

14:06.000 --> 14:08.850
Does he look like me?

14:09.540 --> 14:10.060
Yes.

14:10.790 --> 14:14.320
You look very similar to that man, Jean Valjean.

14:14.920 --> 14:15.860
I see.

14:16.880 --> 14:18.650
However, I...

14:20.180 --> 14:25.160
Of course. How can that man be the mayor of this town?

14:25.770 --> 14:27.290
Please forget what I have said.

14:30.310 --> 14:31.710
It is nothing.

14:36.360 --> 14:37.170
Here you go.

14:41.120 --> 14:41.930
Alain.

14:41.950 --> 14:43.300
Ah, Sister.

14:43.950 --> 14:45.060
Are you going back home now?

14:45.080 --> 14:48.640
Yes, I have to hurry back home and prepare dinner.

14:48.660 --> 14:52.150
Daniel and Marie are waiting for me with their grumbling stomachs.

14:52.790 --> 14:58.650
You're taking care of your siblings alone at such a young age. How admirable.

14:58.840 --> 14:59.710
Not really...

15:00.680 --> 15:02.820
Oh, right. Here.

15:04.600 --> 15:07.660
The family that I visited just now gave me some cookies.

15:08.890 --> 15:11.330
I shall give them to your siblings as a present.

15:12.230 --> 15:14.960
It looks delicious, right?

15:18.110 --> 15:21.470
This is your share. How many siblings do you have?

15:23.490 --> 15:24.260
F-Five.

15:25.830 --> 15:28.850
You should not lie. Lying is a sin.

15:29.290 --> 15:31.350
Yes. I have two.

15:32.880 --> 15:33.350
Yes.

15:39.300 --> 15:42.740
I wish that Alain would never again commit the sin of lying.

15:44.890 --> 15:48.580
I hope you and your siblings will be able to live a happy life.

15:49.770 --> 15:51.500
Thank you very much, Sister.

15:58.730 --> 16:00.420
Daniel! Marie!

16:02.570 --> 16:04.220
The cookies look delicious!

16:04.240 --> 16:05.300
You both can eat all of them.

16:05.620 --> 16:07.570
Really? Can we really eat all of them?

16:07.870 --> 16:08.560
Yes.

16:08.910 --> 16:10.470
Marie, each of us will get three.

16:13.790 --> 16:15.020
It's delicious!

16:15.040 --> 16:16.060
It's tasty!

16:27.850 --> 16:28.990
Get out of here!

16:31.100 --> 16:35.640
Didn't I say my shop only accepts money?
If you don't have any money, get out!

16:36.270 --> 16:39.710
Damn. Who do you think I am?!

16:39.980 --> 16:42.590
I'm Monsieur Fauchelevent.

16:43.200 --> 16:45.510
Even Fauchelevent has fallen to such a dire state.

16:45.950 --> 16:48.350
Long ago he was an influential man.

16:48.370 --> 16:50.510
They called him a distinguished wise man.

16:50.910 --> 16:54.140
But right now, he's desolate and bankrupt.

16:56.670 --> 16:58.190
Damn...

17:00.880 --> 17:02.150
Get a hold of yourself.

17:02.170 --> 17:02.900
Come on...

17:05.130 --> 17:09.160
It's that guy's fault. All my troubles happened after that migrant came to town.

17:09.510 --> 17:11.200
It's all Madeleine's fault.

17:12.230 --> 17:15.330
What?! Mayor Madeleine is an outstanding person.

17:15.900 --> 17:19.670
That's right. After he came, life in this town became much comfortable.

17:19.680 --> 17:25.890
My husband and my younger sister are working Monsieur
Madeleine's factory. They both are grateful to him.

17:26.410 --> 17:31.260
That guy. We don't know what evil deeds he has done before!

17:34.910 --> 17:39.020
Ah... Aren't you... Madeleine?

17:39.420 --> 17:42.980
What? That drunkard... He has only realized it now.

17:43.210 --> 17:48.030
Don't be conceited, Madeleine! I'll show you my wrath!

17:53.180 --> 17:55.250
Welcome back, Monsieur Madeleine.

17:55.810 --> 17:57.330
Thanks for your hard work.

18:02.530 --> 18:03.800
Monsieur Madeleine.

18:04.190 --> 18:06.590
Thank you very much for hiring me.

18:13.620 --> 18:15.640
I will work hard.

18:21.840 --> 18:24.320
My my, the economy is horrible.

18:25.130 --> 18:29.280
This means we won't have enough to feed the unnecessary person's mouth.

18:33.260 --> 18:34.740
Is it the wild dog again?!

18:35.310 --> 18:36.290
Cosette!

18:37.770 --> 18:41.330
Chase him away! It'll be troublesome if it stays here!

18:41.690 --> 18:42.250
Yes.

18:50.610 --> 18:52.220
Chou Chou, keep quiet.

18:56.500 --> 18:58.930
I'll sleep with you tonight.

18:59.540 --> 19:02.940
So, don't cry. You won't be lonely, right?

19:05.340 --> 19:09.030
Chou Chou, where's your mother?

19:10.260 --> 19:12.910
Don't you want to meet your mother?

19:14.890 --> 19:20.370
If you want to stay here, Gavroche and I...

19:21.440 --> 19:24.000
...will be glad.

19:36.990 --> 19:38.180
Chou Chou? Chou Chou!

19:39.290 --> 19:40.770
Who did this?!

19:42.290 --> 19:44.230
Who did such a thing?!

19:46.710 --> 19:51.710
I can't use such torn sheets. How are we going to do business at the inn?!

19:53.010 --> 19:56.090
It's my favorite piece of clothing. It's terrible!

20:00.270 --> 20:01.410
<i>C-Could it be...</i>

20:01.690 --> 20:04.540
There shouldn't be a lot of people who can come in here.

20:05.270 --> 20:06.000
It is...

20:09.240 --> 20:11.090
So it was hiding in such a place!

20:12.910 --> 20:14.300
Gavroche! Chou Chou!

20:14.660 --> 20:17.510
Gavroche hid this animal in his room.

20:18.200 --> 20:22.140
Cosette, it's you, right?! You are the one who brought back that dog!

20:22.540 --> 20:24.480
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

20:25.580 --> 20:26.690
This dog...

20:26.710 --> 20:27.560
Don't!

20:30.210 --> 20:33.740
The cost of the sheets... I will pay it back with my work!

20:33.760 --> 20:36.610
So, please... forgive Chou Chou.

20:38.890 --> 20:41.700
He didn't do it on purpose. Please...

20:42.180 --> 20:44.680
Stop spouting your rubbish! Don't get so cheeky!

20:44.690 --> 20:47.290
It's not something you can pay back by working!

20:47.310 --> 20:48.350
Tam really mad!

20:49.110 --> 20:50.420
I'll punish you!

21:02.160 --> 21:03.180
Cosette!

21:08.090 --> 21:09.230
Stop it!

21:09.420 --> 21:12.150
That's fine. I think that's enough.

21:12.420 --> 21:16.110
We still have to make her work for us.

21:17.680 --> 21:19.950
Geez... She's such a stubborn child!

21:19.970 --> 21:20.910
I don't care anymore!

21:24.770 --> 21:26.430
Cosette...

21:32.820 --> 21:38.050
Cosette... my Cosette... how are you doing?

21:38.490 --> 21:40.510
Mother is also doing her best at work.

21:41.330 --> 21:44.240
Just wait a little longer. I will definitely bring you back.

21:45.750 --> 21:50.810
You are turning 7 years old. I wonder what
kind of a girl you have grown up into.

21:53.130 --> 21:57.950
Cosette... I want to see you soon. My Cosette...

22:13.470 --> 22:16.480
ma maman (my mother)

22:17.440 --> 22:20.650
I like you very much, Mother

22:17.440 --> 22:20.650
Daisukiyo nee okaasan

22:21.310 --> 22:24.690
I love you, Mother

22:21.310 --> 22:24.690
Aishiteru nee okaasan

22:25.320 --> 22:29.160
Your warm inviting scent

22:25.320 --> 22:29.160
Atataku ii nioi

22:29.160 --> 22:32.490
My precious mother

22:29.160 --> 22:32.490
Taisetsuna okaasan

22:33.330 --> 22:36.410
As long as you call out to me

22:33.330 --> 22:36.410
Yobikakeru sore dake de

22:37.370 --> 22:40.580
It brings me joy, Mother

22:37.370 --> 22:40.580
Ureshii no nee okaasan

22:41.290 --> 22:45.340
My only mother

22:41.290 --> 22:45.340
Kono sekai ni tatta hitori

22:45.340 --> 22:48.430
in this world

22:45.340 --> 22:48.430
Watashi no okaasan

22:49.760 --> 22:51.590
Hug me tightly

22:49.760 --> 22:51.590
Dakishimete gyutto

22:51.590 --> 22:53.560
Kiss me gently

22:51.590 --> 22:53.560
Kisu wo shitte sotto

22:53.560 --> 23:01.310
Always be by my side

22:53.560 --> 23:01.310
Itsudemo watashi no soba ni ite ne

23:01.810 --> 23:04.570
On the path lined with chestnut trees

23:01.810 --> 23:04.570
Maronie no michi

23:04.570 --> 23:09.530
we walk hand-in-hand

23:04.570 --> 23:09.530
Futari te wo tori aruku

23:09.530 --> 23:13.240
If we sing together,

23:09.530 --> 23:13.240
Isshoni utaeba

23:13.240 --> 23:17.410
we can have fun with just that.

23:13.240 --> 23:17.410
Tanoshii ne sore dake de

23:17.700 --> 23:21.620
Bathing in the sunlight filtering through the canopy

23:17.700 --> 23:21.620
Komorebi no naka yureru

23:21.620 --> 23:25.630
Your beautiful eyes

23:21.620 --> 23:25.630
Kirei na hitomi

23:25.630 --> 23:29.260
And that gentle smile

23:25.630 --> 23:29.260
Yawaraka na hohoemi de

23:29.260 --> 23:34.930
envelop me.

23:29.260 --> 23:34.930
Watashi wo tsutsumu no

23:39.640 --> 24:09.510
Preview

23:41.570 --> 23:42.720
Chou Chou is really white.

23:42.740 --> 23:43.680
Your thoughts are only on that?

23:43.700 --> 23:45.970
Nah, I will leave it to the audience.

23:45.990 --> 23:48.180
Ah, Javert said life imprisonment. What is it?

23:48.200 --> 23:51.450
That means to remain in the prison for your entire lifetime.

23:51.460 --> 23:53.350
It seems Jean Valjean did some really bad things.

23:53.380 --> 23:55.120
But it could be a mistake.

23:55.130 --> 23:58.440
If I explain it, it will take up a lot of time. So everyone, please read the novel.

23:58.460 --> 24:01.710
Next episode is: Mother's Letter.

24:01.720 --> 24:03.950
Ah... It's about the letter from Fantine.

24:03.970 --> 24:05.780
I heard Éponine is also going to school.

24:04.500 --> 24:09.510
Mother's Letter

24:24.520 --> 24:29.610
Look forward to the next Episode!
